OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOvercast
OL,6,Fwith rain spreading across the region
OL,7,Fduring the evening from the northwest.
OL,8,FThe rain, heavy at times, will turn
OL,9,Flighter and patchier towards dawn.
OL,10,FWinds strengthen and become blustery
OL,11,Fin places. Temperatures around average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FMostly cloudy to start with
OL,14,Fpatchy light rain, turning partly
OL,15,Fcloudy and drier but with some showers
OL,16,Fdeveloping in places. Blustery winds
OL,17,Fwith temperatures just above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
